  "description": "The late crime boss’s final command: \n\n“Protect my daughter!” \n\nJason, a clumsy hitman flown in from Mexico, begins an unexpected childcare mission in Suyu-dong, Seoul. But the three-year-old girl turns out to be far more terrifying than her father ever was. From chaotic tantrums to outrageous antics, Jason’s new life becomes a nonstop disaster of survival parenting. And when she starts daycare, he realizes the chaos has only just begun.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=847842), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13740307)",
